    ]
  },
  "limitations": [
    "No global lighting change is inferred. This is a material/colour contrast audit, not a validation of every scene light or lighting condition.",
    "The opaque model control region is identical in the matched interior comparison; camera, tick, DLL and furniture banks match. This supports the material explanation but does not measure the light buffer independently.",
    "Current installed texture hashes are recorded; the original before-capture metadata did not embed production material hashes. External texture hashes can be checked against their capture metadata.",
    "The initial indoor comparison uses external material V1; its shared wall PNG is byte-identical to V2, while V2 additionally paints sand and fungal ground.",
    "Quiet and worn now share one PNG per material role. This study restores the three value roles but does not introduce six separately weathered textures.",
    "Single camera and tick; the selected clean horizontal run does not cover every wall orientation, dynamic light or all damage details.",
    "Luma figures are encoded RGB proxies. Bilinear import statistics are a CPU approximation; final native PNG measurements include the actual game GPU pipeline."
  ]
}
